findings.description:
The two-branch fence regex `(`{3,})([^`
]*)$|(~{3,})([^
]*)$` forces a five-argument callback with `ticks ?? tildes` and `tickInfo ?? tildeInfo` fallbacks. A single group, `(`{3,}|~{3,})([^
]*)$`, plus a check that leaves a backtick fence alone when its info contains a backtick, would remove the paired optional parameters.
